  "title": "Irish Soda Bread with Caraway Seeds",
  "description": "This soda bread recipe made with flour, baking soda, buttermilk, sour cream, and caraway seeds is sweetened with raisins. Best served warm with butter.",
  "authors": [
    "Penguin Lady"
  ],
